Tigris's tiger
--------------

In October 2026 Tigris redrew the tiger in pixels for its README, keeping
the idea of this logo: a face half in light and half in shadow, one eye
watching. It was rendered by an image model and crushed to a 96-pixel
grid and a 27-colour palette; art/README.md says how, and how to make it
again. The logo above stays in the tree as TIGER's.

